 "remarks": "Enjoy comfortable living in this charming detached cottage. Home features 2 bedrooms, 1 full and 1 half bathroom, a welcoming living room, and a functional kitchen. The rental includes two dedicated parking spaces, adding to the convenience of everyday living. Utilities Included: Electricity, water, and sewer are included in the rent. Tenant is responsible for oil heat. The landlord takes care of all exterior maintenance, allowing for easy, low-maintenance living. A wonderful opportunity to enjoy the privacy and comfort of a separate cottage in a desirable Stamford location! Ideally situated near local parks, walking trails, shopping, grocery stores, restaurants, and everyday conveniences. Enjoy nearby outdoor recreation at Mianus River Park and Fort Stamford Park, with additional shopping and dining options along High Ridge Road and throughout Stamford.",
